WEBVTT

00:31:26.290 --> 00:31:30.271
SK: I also missed nature, going outside,

00:31:30.295 --> 00:31:34.306
sun, rain, wind, fresh air.

00:31:34.330 --> 00:31:37.927
People become depressed without that sun.

00:31:37.951 --> 00:31:39.886
AG: I'm imagining it's something like

00:31:39.910 --> 00:31:43.266
wake up in the morning
and then wait for the Earth to rise?

00:31:43.290 --> 00:31:45.986
SK: Yeah, so (Laughs) --

00:31:46.010 --> 00:31:47.655
Yeah, "earthrise."

00:31:47.679 --> 00:31:49.909
Never heard it that way, put it that way,

00:31:49.933 --> 00:31:52.376
but yeah, that's a good way to put it.

00:31:52.400 --> 00:31:56.186
AG: For Scott, every day
started feeling like "Groundhog Day."

00:31:56.210 --> 00:32:02.586
SK: I would generally wake up
at around 6:15,